        "notes": "Now if you are having trouble surviving in while in Death Blossom, take  [Crimson Cloak](item_975a9a8f-a4bf-4f6a-8552-93f70a070308) as that will help sustain you. But I would take  [Wreath of Ruin](item_8581ce4b-3997-4639-91ea-7d7eec3029e1) over  [Crimson Cloak](item_975a9a8f-a4bf-4f6a-8552-93f70a070308) because:\n\n1.  [Wreath of Ruin](item_8581ce4b-3997-4639-91ea-7d7eec3029e1) has increased range for  [Crowd Control](item_1fc331d5-598d-496c-ad61-2bd12a9ce174) to trigger. You also want range for  [Devastation](item_085f627a-5f84-4df6-8d9e-cda842a2c239) to poke the enemy and potentially giving you 25 extra Health.\n\n2.  [Wreath of Ruin](item_8581ce4b-3997-4639-91ea-7d7eec3029e1) also gives a 20% extra  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) which can also translate to survivability.\n\n3.  [Crimson Cloak](item_975a9a8f-a4bf-4f6a-8552-93f70a070308) is most effective later on in the game as in late game, people would have more health which will translate to more overhealth with  [Crimson Cloak](item_975a9a8f-a4bf-4f6a-8552-93f70a070308)",
